    {
      "description": "Request native cancel, terminate or cleanup for an exact execution/workflow/run triple. A delivered request is not proof of closure: inspect the execution again. Termination requires a reason; cleanup requires an already-terminal execution.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
